            <button type="button" class="btn @(ThemeConstants.Button.FillMode.Outline == ThemeConstants.Button.FillMode.Solid ? "btn-secondary" : "btn-outline-secondary")" @onclick="@(() => _showConfirmCandidateDialog = false)">Cancel</button>
            @* Deliberately always enabled. Gating this on the label deadlocked the dialog: the field
